{
  "info": {
    "name": "LogiChain V2 — M01 Auth & RBAC",
    "description": "Suite di verifica backend M01 (Autenticazione JWT e RBAC Granulare).\n\nCOME USARLA:\n1) Avvia il backend (npm run dev).\n2) Nel .env imposta ADMIN_EMAIL e ADMIN_PASSWORD, poi:\n   npm run seed_ruoli_permessi && npm run seed_admin\n3) Allinea le variabili di collection admin_email/admin_password a quelle del .env.\n4) Apri Runner -> seleziona questa collection -> Run.\n\nIl setup esegue solo il login Admin (già creato via seed).\nL'utente di test (Resp. Magazzino) viene creato al test 03 con email univoca via timestamp.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_postman_id": "5d98976f-ddf1-4dda-8bd1-9c89fc84d04a"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "id": "33a43d11-d950-4324-824c-fbe509a0b134",
      "name": "0. Setup — Login Admin",
      "item": [
        {
          "id": "44baafe3-f625-48f9-8493-7998453e821d",
          "name": "Login Admin",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{admin_email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{admin_password}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "id": "32c43bcd-d06d-4c19-877c-c2514651dd0f",
                "exec": [
                  "var run = Date.now().toString();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('runId', run);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('test_email', 'test.m01.mag.' + run + '@logichain.it');",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('test_email_dup', 'test.m01.mag.' + run + '@logichain.it');"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "id": "dfc68c97-42de-4257-998c-3630d9cbfb78",
                "exec": [
                  "var b = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Setup: Login Admin -> 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Setup: token presente', () => pm.expect(b.data && b.data.token).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "if (b.data && b.data.token) { pm.collectionVariables.set('token_admin', b.data.token); }"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
